# Applies repo-wide since the Docker build context for
# audit-engagement-co-pilot/Dockerfile is the portfolio root (it needs
# several sibling projects in context -- see that Dockerfile's header
# comment). Each project's own node_modules/.venv is rebuilt fresh inside
# the image for the right platform/architecture rather than copied in.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/logs
**/.git
**/*.pyc
audit-rag-assistant/app/.venv
